  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mi>K</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>N</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;Has least value then"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></math>&nbsp;is not divisible by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math>",
