  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mi>K</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mfenced><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>On comparing this with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mi>D</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>26</mn><mn>13</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>That means,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is divisible by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math>.</p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>"
  }
